🎬 Movie Ratings & Budget Analysis Dashboard
📊 Project Overview

This project is an interactive Movie Ratings & Budget Analysis Dashboard created using Tableau.

The dashboard analyzes movie data across different years and genres to understand movie budgets, audience and critic ratings, genre-wise movie production, and top-budget movies.

🎯 Objectives
Analyze movie budgets across different genres and years
Compare audience ratings and critic ratings
Identify the relationship between audience and critic ratings
Analyze the number of movies released by genre over time
Identify the top-budget movies
Compare movie trends across different years
Present movie insights through interactive Tableau visualizations
