🔍 Key Insights
The number of movies released varies across different genres and years.
Comedy and Action genres have a comparatively higher number of movies in several years.
Audience and critic ratings show a visible relationship, with many movies receiving similar rating patterns.
Movie budgets vary significantly across genres and years.
Action movies generally have some of the highest budgets compared with other genres.
The dashboard highlights the movies with the highest budgets, helping identify major high-investment films.
Year-wise analysis helps understand how movie production and budgets changed over time.
